{"articleNo":"406409","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=406409&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 『2022년 청소년 아시아 평화 쇼츠 공모전』 홍보","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.09.23","hit":"4285","attachments":[{"name":"2022 청소년 아시아 평화 쇼츠 공모전_공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=406409&attachNo=116702"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehBOCHkCqA1AZgFQBYBEDWAbNAMQHMArAewEViApGgBQFMA6ABwDtig%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11.4pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11.4pt;\">사 업 명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11.4pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11.4pt;\">청소년 아시아 평화 쇼츠 공모전</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">대    상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">대한민국에 거주 중인 만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">13~24</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">세 청소년 개인 및 팀 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">일    정 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">: &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">접수기간 -</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">&nbsp;2022</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">25</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; margin-left: 37pt; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">최종발표 -&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">&nbsp;2022</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">홈페이지 및 개별 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">주    제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">: “</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">청소년이 바라보는 아시아 평화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">공존 및 문화교류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">”</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; margin-left: 37pt; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">                   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;\">음식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;\">문화교류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;\">여행 에피소드 등 </span><u><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;\">아시아와 관련된 내용 중 자유롭게 선택</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 200%; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">작품형태 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">순수창작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">패러디</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">뮤직비디오</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.4pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.4pt;\">애니메이션